<title>NETHERLANDS: UNILEVER SEES FAVOURABLE CONDITIONS.</title>
<headline>UNILEVER SEES FAVOURABLE CONDITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unilever NV/Plc said on Tuesday business conditions for 1997 looked generally favourable.</p>
<p>&quot;Looking ahead, the overall economic situation in 1997 is likely to be similar to 1996; generally favourable,&quot; Unilever NV chairman Morris Tabaksblat said.</p>
<p>&quot;We are confident that the accelerated restructuring programme we have put in place, together with sharper category focus, better innovation and the new organisation, will enable us to improve profitability further in 1997,&quot; he said</p>
</text>
